so proud of this fully packed room last night at SILO for our @changethebeatofficial NY workshop! thank you to everyone who came out to be a part of this amazing community event and a big shout out to our panelists who showed up and shared their expertise. we had such a great conversation about building a bookable artist profile followed by an A&R panel and demo feedback session where we got through 18 demos 🤯then killer DJ sets! 

i love events like this which can truly bring the community together and facilitate change, especially because we’re often left to our own devices when it comes to navigating this industry. it’s always been about more than just the music for me. i truly hope everyone that came left feeling inspired and more supported in some way. v grateful for this community and our culture 🫶🏽

