Kassa Overall, New York City Winter Jazzfest, and Ace Hotel Brooklyn are pleased to announce a new album listening party and panel discussion event on January 8th, 2025 from 6pm-9pm in the Lobby at Ace Hotel Brooklyn.

Celebrating Kassa Overall’s acclaimed album CREAM during NYC Winter Jazzfest, the event will be time for fans and audience members to listen to the album together and hear a panel discussion between Kassa Overall and the acclaimed music writers Dan Charnas (Dilla Time, The Big Payback) and Marcus J. Moore (The New York Times, High and Rising, The Butterfly Effect). After the panel discussion there will be a DJ set to finish off the party.

