Mark your calendars for a very special night at Signal Brooklyn — Friday, November 7 — where I’ll share the decks with Andrey Pushkarev & Lola Palmer. 🌙🎶
When I launched Devilish Affair back in 2021, my music found its way onto Andrey’s radar, and he’s since featured a few releases in his sought-after podcasts and charts. 🎧
 Lola’s been on my radar since her 2022 Somewhere New EP and recently joined the label with a beautiful remix contribution. 💿✨

My good friend Bajro will be kicking things off with a happy hour set — he also found me through the music. He’s got incredible taste and top-notch technical skills, so come early. 🎛️🔥
For me, this lineup feels like a natural meeting point. 

Signal has quickly built a reputation for its sound and carefully chosen lineups — this one’s no exception, and it’s a super rare opportunity to catch Andrey and Lola on the same night. 🔊
Big thanks to Josh & the Signal team for making it happen. 🙏

