This Saturday, December 20th, Non-Friction Records presents the first annual Beautiful Sweater Party, a one of a kind club night celebrating New York’s finest knits and most fabulous crochets.

Join the crew and special guest Eli Soul Clap as they go back to back (& shoulder to shoulder) for an expertly woven fam jam, stitching together premium quality sonic threads, from gorgeously pilly grooves to the fuzziest deep cuts, with just enough comfy cozy classics layered in-between for a perfect wear and fit.

This holiday season, a new tradition awaits. United by the beat, join us on the dancefloor at Dead Letter no 9 as we come together as Brooklyn’s most beautiful sweaters.

